 orders of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".largestFirst"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".smallestLast"},{"type":"text","text":" and the connected sequential strategies are those of the whole graph with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the preset vertices skipped (whole-graph degrees); DSatur counts preset colours in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saturation from the start; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".independentSet"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s class k starts without the neighbours of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices preset to k; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".coloredNeighbors"},{"type":"text","text":" counts preset neighbours as coloured and takes its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first vertex from its heap. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"colorCount"},{"type":"text","text":" is one more than the greatest colour, so preset"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"colours may leave some colours unused. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presetColor"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per vertex, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order. The strategy’s time, plus O(n + m) to check the presets."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/greedyColoring(strategy:presetColor:)"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ColoringModule/documentation/ColoringModule/GraphProtocols":{"title":"GraphProtocols","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ColoringModule\/documentation\/ColoringModule\/GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol","type":"topic",